# Ecosystem Product Boundary

Authoritative registry: `ecosystem-contracts/apps.json`.

Ecosystem products (exactly six): XFlow, Verixet, AudAiX, RatAiFy, WordGeni, Crevux.

PitStrike is a user-connected **external/personal** app only. It is not product #7.

Do not infer membership from `apps/` folders, Git discovery, Cursor repo lists, or extra XFlow worktrees (`xflow-master-release`, `XFlow-phase4b-pr`, `XFlow-push-through`). Canonical XFlow is `apps/XFlow`.

Do not modify PitStrike source during ecosystem work. Preserve XFlow connection adapters that treat `pitstrike` as a connected user app.
